    {"id":"cimicoxib","name":"Cimicoxib (Cimalgex)","name_ja":"シミコキシブ（シマルジェクス）","category":"nsaids","mechanism":"Selective COX-2 inhibitor; anti-inflammatory and analgesic","mechanism_ja":"選択的COX-2阻害薬。抗炎症・鎮痛","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"2 mg/kg PO q24h","notes_ja":"OA・周術期疼痛","notes":"OA, perioperative pain"}},"side_effects":"GI upset, renal effects","side_effects_ja":"消化器症状、腎への影響","contraindications":"Renal/hepatic disease, concurrent NSAIDs","contraindications_ja":"腎/肝疾患、他のNSAID併用","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"phenylbutazone_equine","name":"Phenylbutazone (Equine Oral)","name_ja":"フェニルブタゾン（馬用経口）","category":"nsaids","mechanism":"Non-selective COX inhibitor; potent anti-inflammatory for musculoskeletal pain","mechanism_ja":"非選択的COX阻害薬。筋骨格疼痛に対する強力な抗炎症薬","species_info":{"horse":{"dose":"2.2-4.4 mg/kg PO q12h（短期）; 維持2.2 mg/kg q24h","notes_ja":"馬の鎮痛第一選択。右背側結腸潰瘍リスク→最低有効量で短期使用。低アルブミン血症で毒性↑","notes":"First-line equine NSAID. Right dorsal colitis risk. Use lowest effective dose, shortest duration"}},"side_effects":"GI ulceration (right dorsal colitis), renal papillary necrosis, bone marrow suppression","side_effects_ja":"消化管潰瘍（右背側結腸炎）、腎乳頭壊死、骨髄抑制","contraindications":"GI ulceration, renal disease, hypoproteinemia, <6 months age, ponies (sensitive)","contraindications_ja":"消化管潰瘍、腎疾患、低蛋白血症、6ヶ月齢未満、ポニー（感受性高い）","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"other_nsaids","severity":"major","description_ja":"消化管毒性の著明な増加","description":"Markedly increased GI toxicity"},{"drug":"warfarin","severity":"major","description_ja":"抗凝固効果増強","description":"Enhanced anticoagulant effect"}]},
    {"id":"flunixin_paste","name":"Flunixin Meglumine (Equine Paste)","name_ja":"フルニキシンメグルミン（馬用ペースト）","category":"nsaids","mechanism":"Non-selective COX inhibitor; potent anti-endotoxemic properties","mechanism_ja":"非選択的COX阻害薬。強力な抗エンドトキシン作用","species_info":{"horse":{"dose":"1.1 mg/kg IV/PO q12h（最大5日間）","notes_ja":"疝痛・エンドトキシン血症・筋骨格疼痛。疝痛の鎮痛マスキングに注意","notes":"Colic, endotoxemia, musculoskeletal pain. CAUTION: may mask colic severity"}},"side_effects":"GI ulceration, renal papillary necrosis, injection site necrosis (IM causes myonecrosis)","side_effects_ja":"消化管潰瘍、腎乳頭壊死、注射部位壊死（IM投与で筋壊死）","contraindications":"IM injection (causes myonecrosis), concurrent NSAIDs, renal disease","contraindications_ja":"IM注射（筋壊死）、他のNSAID併用、腎疾患","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"aminoglycosides","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"腎毒性増加","description":"Increased nephrotoxicity"}]},
    {"id":"alfaxalone_injectable","name":"Alfaxalone (Alfaxan)","name_ja":"アルファキサロン（アルファキサン）","category":"anesthetics","mechanism":"Neuroactive steroid; positive modulator of GABA-A receptor. Rapid onset, smooth induction","mechanism_ja":"神経活性ステロイド。GABA-A受容体の正のモジュレーター。速効性、スムーズな導入","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"導入: 2-3 mg/kg IV to effect; IM: 5-10 mg/kg","notes_ja":"プロポフォールの代替。IM投与可能。ステロイドだが内分泌影響なし","notes":"Propofol alternative. IM route available. No endocrine effects despite steroid structure"},"cat":{"dose":"導入: 2-5 mg/kg IV to effect; IM: 5-10 mg/kg","notes_ja":"猫の麻酔導入に推奨。IM投与可能でプロポフォールより安全マージン広い","notes":"Recommended for feline induction. IM route available, wider safety margin than propofol"},"rabbit":{"dose":"3-5 mg/kg IV; 8-12 mg/kg IM","notes_ja":"ウサギの麻酔導入。IM投与可能","notes":"Rabbit induction. IM route available"},"bird":{"dose":"10-15 mg/kg IM/IV","notes_ja":"鳥類の麻酔導入","notes":"Avian induction"},"reptile":{"dose":"5-20 mg/kg IM/IV（種により大幅に異なる）","notes_ja":"爬虫類の麻酔導入。作用時間は温度依存","notes":"Reptilian induction. Duration temperature-dependent"},"ferret":{"dose":"3-5 mg/kg IV; 5-10 mg/kg IM","notes_ja":"フェレットの麻酔導入","notes":"Ferret induction"},"guinea_pig":{"dose":"5-10 mg/kg IM","notes_ja":"モルモットの麻酔導入","notes":"Guinea pig induction"},"hamster":{"dose":"5-10 mg/kg IP","notes_ja":"ハムスターの麻酔導入","notes":"Hamster induction"}},"side_effects":"Apnea (rapid IV), dose-dependent respiratory depression, transient excitement","side_effects_ja":"無呼吸（急速IV）、用量依存性呼吸抑制、一過性興奮","contraindications":"None absolute; caution with hepatic disease","contraindications_ja":"絶対的禁忌なし。肝疾患では注意","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"benzodiazepines","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"鎮静の相加（用量削減可能）","description":"Additive sedation (dose reduction possible)"}]},
    {"id":"propofol_injectable","name":"Propofol","name_ja":"プロポフォール","category":"anesthetics","mechanism":"Potentiates GABA-A receptor; ultra-short acting. Rapid onset and recovery","mechanism_ja":"GABA-A受容体を増強。超短時間作用。速効性で回復も早い","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"導入: 4-6 mg/kg IV to effect; CRI維持: 0.2-0.4 mg/kg/min","notes_ja":"麻酔導入のゴールドスタンダード。To effect（ゆっくりボーラス）","notes":"Gold standard induction. Titrate to effect (slow bolus)"},"cat":{"dose":"導入: 4-8 mg/kg IV to effect","notes_ja":"猫の反復投与でハインツ小体性貧血→連日使用を避ける。アルファキサロンが代替","notes":"Repeated use causes Heinz body anemia in cats. Avoid consecutive day use. Alfaxalone alternative"},"horse":{"dose":"2-4 mg/kg IV（ケタミンとの併用で導入）","notes_ja":"Triple drip (GGE+ケタミン+プロポフォール)の一部。TIVA","notes":"Part of triple drip (GGE+ketamine+propofol). TIVA"},"rabbit":{"dose":"6-10 mg/kg IV to effect","notes_ja":"静脈確保が必要。耳介静脈から投与","notes":"IV access required. Administer via auricular vein"},"bird":{"dose":"3-5 mg/kg IV","notes_ja":"短時間処置の導入","notes":"Short procedure induction"}},"side_effects":"Apnea, hypotension, pain on injection, Heinz body anemia (cats, repeated use)","side_effects_ja":"無呼吸、低血圧、注射時疼痛、ハインツ小体性貧血（猫、反復使用）","contraindications":"Egg/soy allergy (lipid emulsion), cats for repeated daily use","contraindications_ja":"卵/大豆アレルギー（脂質乳剤）、猫の連日使用","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"opioids","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"導入用量削減可能（相加的鎮静）","description":"Reduced induction dose needed (additive sedation)"}]},
    {"id":"tiludronate","name":"Tiludronate (Tildren)","name_ja":"チルドロン酸（チルドレン）","category":"musculoskeletal","mechanism":"Bisphosphonate; inhibits osteoclast-mediated bone resorption","mechanism_ja":"ビスホスホネート系。破骨細胞による骨吸収を阻害","species_info":{"horse":{"dose":"1 mg/kg IV CRI over 30min（生理食塩水で希釈）; 10日間0.1 mg/kg IV/day","notes_ja":"ナビキュラー症候群・骨スパビン・骨膜炎。馬専用認可薬","notes":"Navicular syndrome, bone spavin, periostitis. Equine-licensed"}},"side_effects":"Colic (during infusion), transient renal effects, injection site reaction","side_effects_ja":"疝痛（注入中）、一過性腎影響、注射部位反応","contraindications":"Renal failure, concurrent nephrotoxic drugs","contraindications_ja":"腎不全、腎毒性薬併用","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"osphos_equine","name":"Clodronate (Osphos)","name_ja":"クロドロン酸（オスフォス）","category":"musculoskeletal","mechanism":"Bisphosphonate; inhibits osteoclast-mediated bone resorption. IM administration","mechanism_ja":"ビスホスホネート系。破骨細胞による骨吸収阻害。IM投与","species_info":{"horse":{"dose":"1.14 mg/kg IM（頸部筋肉3-4箇所に分割注射）","notes_ja":"ナビキュラー症候群。チルドロン酸と異なりIM投与が可能","notes":"Navicular syndrome. Unlike tiludronate, IM route available"}},"side_effects":"Injection site reaction, colic, renal effects","side_effects_ja":"注射部位反応、疝痛、腎への影響","contraindications":"Renal failure, <4 years age","contraindications_ja":"腎不全、4歳未満","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"misoprostol_gastro","name":"Misoprostol (Gastroprotective)","name_ja":"ミソプロストール（胃粘膜保護）","category":"gastrointestinal","mechanism":"PGE1 analogue; replaces protective prostaglandins depleted by NSAIDs","mechanism_ja":"PGE1アナログ。NSAIDで枯渇した保護的プロスタグランジンを補充","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"2-5 μg/kg PO q8h","notes_ja":"NSAID誘発性消化管潰瘍の予防・治療。オメプラゾールとの併用可","notes":"Prevention/treatment of NSAID-induced GI ulceration. Can combine with omeprazole"},"horse":{"dose":"5 μg/kg PO q8-12h","notes_ja":"NSAID性消化管障害の予防","notes":"NSAID gastropathy prevention"}},"side_effects":"Diarrhea, abdominal cramps, abortion","side_effects_ja":"下痢、腹部痙攣、流産","contraindications":"Pregnancy (abortifacient), breeding animals","contraindications_ja":"妊娠（堕胎作用）、繁殖動物","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"pentosan_polysulfate","name":"Pentosan Polysulfate (Cartrophen Vet)","name_ja":"ポリ硫酸ペントサン（カートロフェン）","category":"musculoskeletal","mechanism":"Disease-modifying osteoarthritis drug (DMOAD); stimulates proteoglycan synthesis, inhibits degradative enzymes","mechanism_ja":"疾患修飾性OA薬（DMOAD）。プロテオグリカン合成促進、分解酵素阻害","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"3 mg/kg SC 1回/週 × 4回; 以後必要に応じて追加","notes_ja":"OAの疾患修飾療法。NSAIDとは異なる機序で軟骨保護","notes":"OA disease modification. Chondroprotective via different mechanism than NSAIDs"},"cat":{"dose":"2-3 mg/kg SC 1回/週 × 4回","notes_ja":"猫のOA。注射で投薬コンプライアンス良好","notes":"Feline OA. Good compliance with injectable route"},"horse":{"dose":"3 mg/kg IM 1回/週 × 4回","notes_ja":"馬のOA補助療法","notes":"Equine OA adjunct"}},"side_effects":"Injection site swelling, transient lethargy, coagulation effects (theoretical)","side_effects_ja":"注射部位腫脹、一過性倦怠感、凝固への影響（理論的）","contraindications":"Coagulopathy, concurrent anticoagulants","contraindications_ja":"凝固障害、抗凝固薬併用","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"heparin","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"出血リスク増加","description":"Increased bleeding risk"}]},
    {"id":"adequan_equine","name":"Polysulfated Glycosaminoglycan (Equine Adequan)","name_ja":"ポリ硫酸化グリコサミノグリカン（馬用アデクアン）","category":"musculoskeletal","mechanism":"Inhibits cartilage degradation enzymes; stimulates synovial fluid synthesis","mechanism_ja":"軟骨分解酵素を阻害。滑液合成を促進","species_info":{"horse":{"dose":"500 mg IM q4日 × 7回; 関節内250 mg","notes_ja":"OA・関節炎。IM全身投与＋関節内投与の二通り","notes":"OA, arthritis. Both systemic IM and intra-articular routes"}},"side_effects":"Injection site reaction, joint flare (IA)","side_effects_ja":"注射部位反応、関節フレア（関節内）","contraindications":"Joint infection, coagulopathy","contraindications_ja":"関節感染、凝固障害","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"oxymorphone_injectable","name":"Oxymorphone Injectable","name_ja":"オキシモルフォン注射","category":"analgesic","mechanism":"Full mu-opioid agonist; potent analgesic (10x morphine potency)","mechanism_ja":"完全μオピオイド作動薬。強力な鎮痛（モルヒネの10倍力価）","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"0.05-0.1 mg/kg IV/IM q4-6h","notes_ja":"中等度～重度疼痛。術後疼痛管理。嘔吐しにくい","notes":"Moderate-severe pain. Post-op analgesia. Low emetic potential"},"cat":{"dose":"0.02-0.05 mg/kg IV/IM q4-6h","notes_ja":"重度疼痛管理","notes":"Severe pain management"}},"side_effects":"Respiratory depression, bradycardia, panting (dogs), dysphoria","side_effects_ja":"呼吸抑制、徐脈、パンティング（犬）、不快感","contraindications":"Head trauma (ICP elevation), severe respiratory disease","contraindications_ja":"頭部外傷（ICP上昇）、重度呼吸器疾患","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"benzodiazepines","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"呼吸抑制増強","description":"Enhanced respiratory depression"}]},
    {"id":"fentanyl_patch","name":"Fentanyl Transdermal Patch","name_ja":"フェンタニル経皮パッチ","category":"analgesic","mechanism":"Full mu-opioid agonist; transdermal delivery for sustained analgesia (72-120h)","mechanism_ja":"完全μオピオイド作動薬。経皮投与で持続鎮痛（72-120時間）","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"2-4 μg/kg/hr; 25μgパッチ(10-20kg), 50μg(20-30kg), 75μg(>30kg)","notes_ja":"術後疼痛・がん疼痛。貼付後12-24h で定常状態→橋渡し鎮痛が必要","notes":"Post-op pain, cancer pain. Steady state 12-24h after application, need bridge analgesia"},"cat":{"dose":"25μgパッチ; 効果12-24h後","notes_ja":"術後疼痛（整形外科等）。毛刈り部に貼付","notes":"Post-op pain (orthopedic). Apply to clipped skin"}},"side_effects":"Respiratory depression, bradycardia, hyperthermia (cats), dysphoria, inappetence","side_effects_ja":"呼吸抑制、徐脈、高体温（猫）、不快感、食欲不振","contraindications":"Head trauma, respiratory compromise, cats <2.5 kg","contraindications_ja":"頭部外傷、呼吸不全、2.5kg未満の猫","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"serotonergic_drugs","severity":"major","description_ja":"セロトニン症候群リスク","description":"Serotonin syndrome risk"}]},
    {"id":"butorphanol_injectable","name":"Butorphanol Injectable","name_ja":"ブトルファノール注射（ベトルファール）","category":"analgesic","mechanism":"Mixed opioid agonist-antagonist; κ-agonist/μ-antagonist. Moderate analgesia with ceiling effect","mechanism_ja":"混合オピオイド作動薬-拮抗薬。κ作動/μ拮抗。天井効果のある中等度鎮痛","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"0.1-0.4 mg/kg IV/IM/SC q2-4h; CRI 0.1-0.2 mg/kg/hr","notes_ja":"軽度～中等度内臓痛。鎮咳。鎮静前投薬（α2作動薬との併用）","notes":"Mild-moderate visceral pain. Antitussive. Sedation premedication (with α2 agonist)"},"cat":{"dose":"0.1-0.4 mg/kg IV/IM/SC q2-6h","notes_ja":"猫の鎮痛・鎮静前投薬。嘔吐少ない","notes":"Feline analgesia, sedation premedication. Low emetic potential"},"horse":{"dose":"0.02-0.1 mg/kg IV","notes_ja":"軽度疝痛。鎮静補助（デトミジンと併用）","notes":"Mild colic. Sedation adjunct (with detomidine)"},"rabbit":{"dose":"0.1-0.5 mg/kg SC/IM q4-6h","notes_ja":"ウサギの術後疼痛。MMBプロトコルの構成薬","notes":"Rabbit post-op pain. Component of MMB protocol"},"bird":{"dose":"1-2 mg/kg IM q2-4h","notes_ja":"鳥類の鎮痛","notes":"Avian analgesia"},"reptile":{"dose":"0.4-1.5 mg/kg IM q12-24h","notes_ja":"爬虫類の鎮痛","notes":"Reptilian analgesia"},"ferret":{"dose":"0.1-0.5 mg/kg IM q4-6h","notes_ja":"フェレットの鎮痛","notes":"Ferret analgesia"},"guinea_pig":{"dose":"0.2-2 mg/kg SC q4h","notes_ja":"モルモットの鎮痛","notes":"Guinea pig analgesia"},"hamster":{"dose":"0.4 mg/kg SC q4h","notes_ja":"ハムスターの鎮痛","notes":"Hamster analgesia"},"hedgehog":{"dose":"0.2-0.4 mg/kg SC q4-6h","notes_ja":"ハリネズミの鎮痛","notes":"Hedgehog analgesia"},"chinchilla":{"dose":"0.2-0.5 mg/kg SC q4h","notes_ja":"チンチラの鎮痛","notes":"Chinchilla analgesia"},"sugar_glider":{"dose":"0.2-0.5 mg/kg SC q4h","notes_ja":"フクロモモンガの鎮痛","notes":"Sugar glider analgesia"}},"side_effects":"Sedation, respiratory depression (minimal), dysphoria, ceiling effect (limited max analgesia)","side_effects_ja":"鎮静、呼吸抑制（最小限）、不快感、天井効果（鎮痛に上限あり）","contraindications":"None absolute; limited efficacy for severe/somatic pain","contraindications_ja":"絶対的禁忌なし。重度/体性疼痛には効果限定的","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"full_mu_agonists","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"μ拮抗作用により完全作動薬の鎮痛を減弱","description":"μ-antagonism may attenuate full agonist analgesia"}]},
    {"id":"buprenorphine_injectable","name":"Buprenorphine Injectable","name_ja":"ブプレノルフィン注射","category":"analgesic","mechanism":"Partial mu-opioid agonist; high receptor affinity, slow onset, long duration (6-12h)","mechanism_ja":"部分μオピオイド作動薬。高い受容体親和性、緩徐な作用発現、長時間作用（6-12h）","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"0.01-0.02 mg/kg IV/IM q6-12h; 口腔粘膜(OTM): 0.02 mg/kg","notes_ja":"中等度疼痛。受容体結合力が強く、ナロキソンで拮抗しにくい","notes":"Moderate pain. Strong receptor binding, difficult to reverse with naloxone"},"cat":{"dose":"0.01-0.03 mg/kg IV/IM q6-12h; OTM: 0.02 mg/kg","notes_ja":"猫の術後疼痛管理の第一選択。口腔粘膜投与で在宅管理可能","notes":"First-line feline post-op pain. OTM route enables home management"},"rabbit":{"dose":"0.02-0.05 mg/kg SC/IM q6-12h","notes_ja":"ウサギの術後疼痛。長時間作用で投与回数少ない","notes":"Rabbit post-op pain. Long duration reduces dosing frequency"},"bird":{"dose":"0.1 mg/kg IM q8-12h","notes_ja":"鳥類の鎮痛","notes":"Avian analgesia"},"reptile":{"dose":"0.02-0.1 mg/kg IM q24h","notes_ja":"爬虫類の鎮痛","notes":"Reptilian analgesia"},"ferret":{"dose":"0.01-0.03 mg/kg IM q8-12h","notes_ja":"フェレットの鎮痛","notes":"Ferret analgesia"},"guinea_pig":{"dose":"0.05 mg/kg SC q8-12h","notes_ja":"モルモットの鎮痛","notes":"Guinea pig analgesia"},"hedgehog":{"dose":"0.01-0.05 mg/kg SC q8-12h","notes_ja":"ハリネズミの鎮痛","notes":"Hedgehog analgesia"}},"side_effects":"Sedation, respiratory depression (dose-dependent), hyperthermia (cats), inappetence","side_effects_ja":"鎮静、呼吸抑制（用量依存性）、高体温（猫）、食欲不振","contraindications":"None absolute; difficult to reverse due to high receptor affinity","contraindications_ja":"絶対的禁忌なし。受容体親和性が高く拮抗困難","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"full_mu_agonists","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"μ受容体を占有し完全作動薬の効果を減弱","description":"Occupies mu receptors, may attenuate full agonist effects"}]},
    {"id":"silver_honey","name":"Medical Grade Manuka Honey","name_ja":"医療用マヌカハニー","category":"dermatology","mechanism":"Osmotic dehydration of bacteria, low pH (3.2-4.5), hydrogen peroxide production, methylglyoxal (MGO) antibacterial","mechanism_ja":"細菌の浸透圧脱水、低pH（3.2-4.5）、過酸化水素産生、メチルグリオキサール（MGO）抗菌","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"患部に5-10mm厚で塗布、包帯で被覆、q12-24h交換","notes_ja":"慢性創傷・熱傷・MRSA感染創・褥瘡","notes":"Chronic wounds, burns, MRSA-infected wounds, pressure sores"},"cat":{"dose":"患部に塗布、包帯で被覆","notes_ja":"慢性創傷・難治性潰瘍","notes":"Chronic wounds, refractory ulcers"},"horse":{"dose":"患部に塗布","notes_ja":"下肢創傷・蹄叉腐爛","notes":"Distal limb wounds, thrush"},"rabbit":{"dose":"患部に塗布","notes_ja":"ソアホック・創傷","notes":"Sore hocks, wounds"},"bird":{"dose":"患部に薄く塗布","notes_ja":"バンブルフット","notes":"Bumblefoot"},"reptile":{"dose":"患部に塗布","notes_ja":"シェルロット・創傷","notes":"Shell rot, wounds"}},"side_effects":"None significant; mild stinging on application","side_effects_ja":"特になし。塗布時の軽度刺痛","contraindications":"None","contraindications_ja":"なし","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"poloxamer_407","name":"Poloxamer 407 Gel (Pluronic F127)","name_ja":"ポロキサマー407ゲル（プルロニックF127）","category":"dermatology","mechanism":"Thermoreversible gel; liquid at cool temperature, gels at body temperature for sustained drug delivery","mechanism_ja":"温度応答性ゲル。低温で液体、体温でゲル化し薬物の持続放出","species_info":{"cat":{"dose":"経皮投与用基剤: 耳介内側に塗布","notes_ja":"メチマゾール・フルオキセチン等の経皮吸収基剤。投薬困難な猫に有用","notes":"Transdermal base for methimazole, fluoxetine etc. Useful for difficult-to-medicate cats"},"dog":{"dose":"経皮投与用基剤: 耳介内側に塗布","notes_ja":"各種薬剤の経皮投与基剤","notes":"Transdermal base for various medications"}},"side_effects":"Local skin irritation (rare), variable absorption","side_effects_ja":"局所皮膚刺激（稀）、吸収のばらつき","contraindications":"None; drug-specific contraindications apply","contraindications_ja":"基剤としての禁忌なし。含有薬剤の禁忌に準拠","drug_interactions":[]},
    {"id":"phenobarbital_oral","name":"Phenobarbital (Oral Anticonvulsant)","name_ja":"フェノバルビタール（経口抗てんかん薬）","category":"behavioral","mechanism":"Enhances GABA-A receptor activity and inhibits glutamate receptors; raises seizure threshold","mechanism_ja":"GABA-A受容体活性を増強しグルタミン酸受容体を抑制。痙攣閾値を上昇","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"2-3 mg/kg PO q12h; 血中濃度15-40 μg/mL目標","notes_ja":"犬のてんかん第一選択。血中濃度モニタリング必須。肝酵素誘導→定期的肝機能検査","notes":"First-line canine epilepsy. TDM required (15-40 μg/mL). Hepatic enzyme induction → regular liver panels"},"cat":{"dose":"1-2 mg/kg PO q12h; 血中濃度15-30 μg/mL目標","notes_ja":"猫のてんかん。レベチラセタムも第一選択肢","notes":"Feline epilepsy. Levetiracetam also first-line option"}},"side_effects":"Sedation, PU/PD/PP, hepatotoxicity, hindlimb ataxia, neutropenia (cats)","side_effects_ja":"鎮静、多飲多尿多食、肝毒性、後肢失調、好中球減少（猫）","contraindications":"Hepatic disease, anemia, respiratory depression","contraindications_ja":"肝疾患、貧血、呼吸抑制","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"chloramphenicol","severity":"major","description_ja":"フェノバルビタール代謝阻害→血中濃度上昇","description":"Inhibits phenobarbital metabolism"},{"drug":"ciclosporin","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"シクロスポリン血中濃度低下（CYP誘導）","description":"Decreased ciclosporin levels (CYP induction)"},{"drug":"doxycycline","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"ドキシサイクリン半減期短縮","description":"Shortened doxycycline half-life"}]},
    {"id":"levetiracetam_oral","name":"Levetiracetam (Keppra)","name_ja":"レベチラセタム（イーケプラ）","category":"behavioral","mechanism":"Binds SV2A synaptic vesicle protein; modulates neurotransmitter release. Novel antiepileptic mechanism","mechanism_ja":"SV2Aシナプス小胞タンパクに結合し神経伝達物質放出を調節。新規抗てんかん機序","species_info":{"dog":{"dose":"20-60 mg/kg PO q8h（通常型）; 30-60 mg/kg PO q12h（徐放型）","notes_ja":"第二選択抗てんかん薬。フェノバルビタール追加療法。肝毒性なし。クラスターてんかんにパルス投与","notes":"Second-line AED. Add-on to phenobarbital. No hepatotoxicity. Pulse dosing for cluster seizures"},"cat":{"dose":"20-60 mg/kg PO q8h","notes_ja":"猫のてんかん。フェノバルビタールの代替第一選択。腎排泄→肝障害猫にも安全","notes":"Feline epilepsy. Alternative first-line. Renal excretion → safe in hepatic disease"}},"side_effects":"Sedation (initial, usually transient), inappetence, ataxia","side_effects_ja":"鎮静（初期、通常一過性）、食欲不振、運動失調","contraindications":"Severe renal failure (adjust dose)","contraindications_ja":"重度腎不全（用量調整）","drug_interactions":[{"drug":"phenobarbital","severity":"moderate","description_ja":"レベチラセタムクリアランス増加→用量増加必要","description":"Increased levetiracetam clearance, may need dose increase"}]},
